      "role": "answer",
      "title": "Move the scheduled budget into condition-based maintenance",
      "body": "Calendar maintenance keeps paying for downtime it cannot see coming; a condition view catches most stops before they happen.",
      "notes": "Lead with the decision; the three slides after it carry the why, the cost and the how.",
      "source_refs": [
        "fraunhofer-2025"
      ],
      "data_refs": []
    },
    {
      "id": "today",
      "order": 2,
      "kind": "section",
      "role": "option",
      "title": "Today: maintenance by the calendar",
      "body": "Fixed intervals, surprise failures; most stops announce themselves first and go unread.",
      "notes": "Keep both options on screen; the contrast between them is the argument.",
      "source_refs": [
        "fraunhofer-2025"
      ],
      "data_refs": []
    },
    {
      "id": "tomorrow",
      "order": 3,
      "kind": "section",
